  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "The cafeteria bustles with noise, students chattering and laughing while
      they eat. You try to blend in with the crowd as much as possible, doing your
      best to remain unnoticed. You must be doing a well enough job at it, as no
      one has questioned your shifty behaviour yet. Inwardly, you can\u2019t help
      but feel proud of your successful sneak-infiltration. You survey the room,
      trying to pick a conversation to listen in on. "
